  "why": "973 pooled (peer, event) pairs clears the k=2-exact 152-pair floor by 6.4x. Still framed exploratory: a governance eligibility floor is not a claim of guaranteed power, and the true analyzed sample will be smaller after same-session NaN exclusion -- see make_hyp08_phase3_run.py's own real result for the actual analyzed count."
